label "Agent-to-agent protocol diagram"
region orgA 16 60 150 140 "org A"
region orgB 294 60 150 140 "org B"
box a 40 110 102 42 "agent"
box b 318 110 102 42 "agent"
box card 178 100 104 62 "agent card|+ task lifecycle" acc
arrow a card
arrow card b
arrow b card dashed via=330,180;250,180
note "both sides stay opaque — the card advertises capability, not implementation"
